WEBVTT

00:04.874 --> 00:11.674
* *
**
**
**

00:11.741 --> 00:14.441
- Okay, Patrick,
one more book,
- 好吧，帕特里克，
又一本书，

00:14.508 --> 00:17.608
then you go to sleep, kay?
- Kay.
然后你去睡觉吧，好吗？
- 凯。

00:17.608 --> 00:21.874
- This one is called
"You Can Be Anything."
- 这个叫
“你可以成为任何人。”

00:25.008 --> 00:26.974
I can be anything?
我可以成为任何人吗？

00:27.041 --> 00:29.608
- Oh, you sure can, pal.
Take a look.
- 哦，你当然可以，朋友。
看看吧。

00:29.674 --> 00:32.641
You can be a firefighter...
你可以成为一名消防员...

00:34.208 --> 00:36.341
- You can be a doctor...
- 你可以成为一名医生...

00:38.008 --> 00:39.841
- You can be a cowboy.
- 你可以成为一名牛仔。

00:39.908 --> 00:41.674
- That's what I want to be!
- 这就是我想成为的人！

00:41.741 --> 00:43.408
- Cowboy. Great choice.
- 牛仔。很棒的选择。

00:43.474 --> 00:44.608
- No, no, no, no, no!
- 不，不，不，不，不！

00:44.674 --> 00:46.874
That.
那。

00:46.941 --> 00:49.341
Buddy, I don't think
you want to be a horse.
伙计，我不认为
你想成为一匹马。

00:49.408 --> 00:51.174
- You said I can be anything,
- 你说我可以成为任何人

00:51.241 --> 00:54.208
and--and I want to be a horse!
而且——我想成为一匹马！

00:54.274 --> 00:56.841
- Sure, sure,
you can be a horse.
- 当然，当然，
你可以成为一匹马。

00:57.741 --> 00:59.308
- Nighty-night, Patrick.
- 晚安，帕特里克。

00:59.374 --> 01:00.408
- A horse.
- 一匹马。

01:00.474 --> 01:02.608
A horse.
一匹马。

01:09.708 --> 01:12.441
Not yet, Gary.
Give me a few more minutes.
还没有，加里。
再给我几分钟。

01:12.508 --> 01:15.474
What
什么

01:15.608 --> 01:17.208
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:26.041 --> 01:28.241
- Oh, horsey!
- 哦，马儿！

01:30.941 --> 01:34.708
Patrick, you were right!
You can be a horse.
帕特里克，你是对的！
你可以成为一匹马。

01:37.341 --> 01:39.908
- Easy there, big fella.
- 放轻松，大伙子。

01:39.974 --> 01:41.608
Easy...
简单的...

01:43.474 --> 01:45.474
Ha!
哈!

01:47.274 --> 01:48.608
- Ah!
- 啊！

01:48.641 --> 01:50.708
That's a good horsey.
这是一匹好马。

01:50.774 --> 01:53.141
Hmm, "horsey."
That's not right.
嗯，“马”。
那是不对的。

01:53.208 --> 01:54.341
You need a name!
你需要一个名字！

01:54.408 --> 01:57.208
I think I'll call you...
我想我会打电话给你...

01:57.274 --> 01:58.508
Patrick!
帕特里克！

02:01.241 --> 02:02.674
- Whoa!
- 哇！

02:02.741 --> 02:05.374
Ride 'em, cowboy!
骑上它们吧，牛仔！

02:12.941 --> 02:15.508
Uh, bucking bronco.
呃，狂野的野马。

02:17.841 --> 02:20.041
- Rodeo clown.
- 牛仔竞技小丑。

02:20.108 --> 02:21.741
* *
**
**
**

02:21.808 --> 02:24.608
- Safety first.
- 安全第一。

02:24.674 --> 02:27.974
- Giddy up, Patrick.
- 头晕，帕特里克。

02:28.041 --> 02:30.741
Looking good, Ms. Sandy.
- Thank you.
看起来不错，桑迪女士。
- 谢谢。

02:30.808 --> 02:33.841
And the horse you rode in on?
你骑的那匹马呢？

02:33.908 --> 02:35.808
- Morning, old timer.
- 早上好，老朋友。

02:42.841 --> 02:44.274
* *
**
**
**

02:47.941 --> 02:50.441
- Sure, but be gentle.
- 当然可以，但是要温柔。

02:55.441 --> 02:56.974
- He's so soft.
- 他太软了

02:57.041 --> 02:59.641
- What's all the hubbub
out here?
- 到底有什么喧嚣
在这里？

02:59.708 --> 03:01.041
- What the...
- 什么...

03:01.108 --> 03:04.608
So Patrick's a horse now?
那么帕特里克现在是一匹马了？

03:04.641 --> 03:05.874
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

03:05.941 --> 03:07.441
Your phony baloney pony's
你的假胡言乱语小马

03:07.508 --> 03:09.508
more like an old gray mare.
更像一匹老灰母马。

03:09.608 --> 03:11.708
Sorry to say, but, uh,
抱歉地说，但是，呃，

03:11.774 --> 03:15.174
this one's ready
for the glue factory.
这个已经准备好了
用于胶水厂。

03:18.641 --> 03:20.208
- What kind of hub--
- 什么样的枢纽--

03:20.274 --> 03:23.408
What are you doing
violating me personal space?
你在做什么
侵犯我的私人空间？

03:26.041 --> 03:27.641
- Aw...
- He's really fuzzy.
- 噢...
- 他真的很模糊。

03:31.608 --> 03:33.141
- Oh!
- 哦！

03:33.208 --> 03:35.174
Horsey rides!
骑马！

03:35.241 --> 03:36.908
Kids love horseys.
孩子们喜欢马。

03:36.974 --> 03:38.908
Great idea
having Patrick play pony.
好主意
让帕特里克扮演小马。

03:38.974 --> 03:40.908
I'll charge these kids
ten bucks a ride
我会向这些孩子收费
十块钱一趟

03:40.974 --> 03:42.608
and cash in big time!
并大赚一笔！

03:42.641 --> 03:43.974
- Oh, I don't know, Mr. Krabs,
- 哦，我不知道，蟹老板先生，

03:44.041 --> 03:46.041
I think Patrick
will only let me ride him.
我认为帕特里克
只会让我骑他。

03:46.108 --> 03:47.841
Oh, nonsense.
哦，废话。

03:47.908 --> 03:51.108
Pony rides! Ten buckaroos!
骑小马！十只巴卡罗！

04:00.708 --> 04:03.608
Giddy up, Patrick.
Giddy up.
头晕目眩，帕特里克。
头晕了。

04:03.608 --> 04:05.441
- Now, I don't mean to nag,
-现在，我并不是要唠叨，

04:05.508 --> 04:07.874
so don't bridle
when I say this,
所以不要勒缰绳
当我说这句话的时候

04:07.941 --> 04:11.874
but your dream horse
is more like a nightmare!
但你的梦想马
更像是一场噩梦！

04:11.941 --> 04:13.308
Get it?
得到它？

04:13.374 --> 04:15.241
Night
Ha-ha!
夜晚
哈哈！

04:22.074 --> 04:24.808
- Oh, yeah,
now you're feeling your oats.
- 哦，是的，
现在你感觉到你的燕麦了。

04:24.874 --> 04:27.341
Ha-ha! I'm so good.
哈哈！我真好啊

04:28.974 --> 04:30.941
Four at a time
一次四个

04:31.008 --> 04:32.674
quadruplicates me money.
使我的钱翻了四倍。

04:32.741 --> 04:35.141
Let's try for five.
我们来试试五个吧。

04:35.208 --> 04:36.141
- Ah!
- 啊！

04:38.808 --> 04:40.341
- Uh-oh. Ooh.
- 呃哦。哦。

04:40.408 --> 04:42.741
Oh! Ooh.
哦！哦。

04:44.708 --> 04:46.708
My wittle weg!
我的小聪明！

04:46.774 --> 04:48.674
all: Yay!
全体：耶！

04:51.608 --> 04:52.474
All right, next up.
好吧，接下来。

04:57.741 --> 05:00.108
My other wittle weg!
我的另一件小事！

05:01.941 --> 05:04.141
Horsey Patrick, come back!
霍西·帕特里克，回来吧！

05:04.208 --> 05:07.874
- That's me money running away!
Come back!
- 那是我的钱跑了！
回来！

05:07.941 --> 05:11.708
- Oh, yes.
Oh, yes, come back.
- 哦是的。
哦，是的，回来吧。

05:11.774 --> 05:15.708
I said,
"Whoa, horsey Patrick."
我说，
“哇哦，小马帕特里克。”

05:15.774 --> 05:18.208
Look at me, I'm a horse.
看看我，我是一匹马。

05:18.274 --> 05:20.641
Clopity, clopity, clopity.
克洛蒂，克洛蒂，克洛蒂。

05:25.741 --> 05:28.641
Clopity, clopity, clopity.
克洛蒂，克洛蒂，克洛蒂。

05:32.974 --> 05:34.908
Patrick.
帕特里克.

05:34.974 --> 05:36.608
Patrick...
帕特里克...

05:36.608 --> 05:38.274
Patrick.
帕特里克.

05:38.341 --> 05:39.908
Patrick!
帕特里克！

05:52.808 --> 05:55.308
Patrick?
帕特里克？

05:55.374 --> 05:57.441
- Hey, it's okay, boy.
- 嘿，没关系，孩子。

05:57.508 --> 05:59.108
It's me...
这就是我...

05:59.174 --> 06:01.274
- Your old pal, SpongeBob.
- 你的老朋友，海绵宝宝。

06:01.341 --> 06:03.208
Remember?
记住？

06:04.841 --> 06:06.441
- Okay...
- 好的...

06:06.508 --> 06:09.374
Would you like me to whisper?
你愿意我轻声细语吗？

06:09.441 --> 06:12.641
- Nice Patrick.
Pretty Patrick.
- 好帕特里克。
漂亮的帕特里克。

06:12.708 --> 06:14.741
Good Patrick.
好帕特里克。

06:15.908 --> 06:17.008
- Calm down, buddy.
- 冷静点，伙计。

06:17.074 --> 06:18.274
I don't want to lose you again.
我不想再次失去你。

06:18.341 --> 06:20.174
- Whoa! Ow! Ow!
- 哇！噢！噢！

06:32.108 --> 06:34.274
- Aw.
And all this time,
- 噢。
而这段时间，

06:34.341 --> 06:36.874
I thought I was the one
breaking you,
我以为我就是那个
打破你，

06:36.941 --> 06:40.674
but you were the one
breaking me.
但你就是那个
让我心碎。

06:44.208 --> 06:47.241
Patrick horsey, giddy up!
帕特里克·霍西，头晕！

06:50.108 --> 06:52.441
* *
**
**
**

06:55.508 --> 06:56.641
* *
**
**
**

07:08.008 --> 07:10.608
- Oh, this is humiliating.
- Quiet.
- 哦，这太丢脸了。
- 安静的。

07:10.608 --> 07:12.208
- Horseys don't talk.
- 马不说话。

07:12.274 --> 07:14.808
Okay, kids, ten bucks a ride!
好吧，孩子们，十块钱一趟！

07:14.874 --> 07:16.808
Who's next?
- Me!
下一个是谁？
- 我！

07:16.874 --> 07:19.608
Get moving, horse!
走吧，马！

07:19.674 --> 07:21.474
- Ow! Cut it out.
- 噢！把它剪掉。

07:23.108 --> 07:25.208
- Wow, Mr. Krabs.
- 哇，蟹老板。

07:25.274 --> 07:27.408
How'd you get Squidward
to give rides?
章鱼哥你是怎么得到的
搭车？

07:27.474 --> 07:29.808
- Hmm...
- 唔...

07:29.874 --> 07:31.608
Says right here
in his contract.
说就在这里
在他的合同中。

07:31.674 --> 07:34.074
"I can work him like a horse."
“我可以像训练一匹马一样训练他。”

07:37.374 --> 07:40.208
- Hey, get your mule away
from my show pony.
- 嘿，把你的骡子带走
来自我的表演小马。

07:40.274 --> 07:42.808
This here's a Thoroughbred.
这是纯种马。

07:42.874 --> 07:44.808
* *
**
**
**

07:44.874 --> 07:47.074
- Look at that flank.
- 看看那个侧面。

07:47.141 --> 07:49.074
- Ah!
- Get a load of those hocks.
- 啊！
- 承受这些飞节的负荷。

07:49.141 --> 07:52.608
- Ah!
- 啊！

07:52.674 --> 07:54.608
- Oh, yeah, I'm a real stud.
- 哦，是的，我是一个真正的种马。

07:54.674 --> 07:57.274
- Now look at
your old pile of dog food.
- 现在看看
你那堆旧狗粮

08:00.274 --> 08:01.974
- I'd put my pile of dog food
- 我会放一堆狗粮

08:02.041 --> 08:03.941
up against your stud any day.
任何一天都会与你的种马对抗。

08:04.008 --> 08:06.308
How 'bout a race, then?
那么，来一场比赛怎么样？

08:06.374 --> 08:08.608
First one to deliver
a Krabby Patty
第一个交付的
蟹肉饼

08:08.608 --> 08:11.308
to Black Devil Bay wins.
以黑魔湾获胜。

08:11.374 --> 08:13.541
- You're on!
- 你来了！

08:13.608 --> 08:16.808
- I want a clean race.
No cheating!
- 我想要一场干净的比赛。
没有作弊！

08:16.874 --> 08:19.374
Wait for the bell.
等待铃声。

08:20.674 --> 08:22.108
Ah!
啊!

08:24.808 --> 08:27.574
- Ha-ha! Eat me dust!
- 哈哈！吃掉我的灰尘吧！

08:27.641 --> 08:29.274
- Well, okay.
- 嗯，好吧。

08:30.941 --> 08:32.474
Mmm.
嗯。

08:37.974 --> 08:39.908
Mmm. Hey, your dust
was delicious!
嗯。嘿，你的尘埃
很好吃！

08:41.008 --> 08:42.341
- This shortcut sign
- 这个快捷标志

08:42.408 --> 08:44.008
should send
SpongeBob and Patrick
应该发送
海绵宝宝和帕特里克

08:44.074 --> 08:45.841
far from the finish line.
距离终点线还很远。

08:47.441 --> 08:49.974
- Hi-ho, Squidward!
- 嘿嘿，章鱼哥！

08:51.041 --> 08:54.174
- Whoa!
Whoa, shortcut.
- 哇！
哇，捷径。

08:54.241 --> 08:56.041
This could be a trick.
这可能是一个诡计。

08:56.108 --> 08:58.341
I love tricks!
我喜欢技巧！

09:09.374 --> 09:11.641
- Whoa, whoa!
- 哇，哇！

09:14.608 --> 09:15.908
Hyah!
哈！

09:15.974 --> 09:18.041
Oh, boy, we're ahead!
哦，孩子，我们领先了！

09:18.108 --> 09:20.341
- No, you're actually behind!
- 不，你实际上落后了！

09:20.408 --> 09:22.608
- Oh...
- 哦...

09:22.641 --> 09:24.508
Whoa, Patrick.
哇，帕特里克。

09:24.608 --> 09:25.641
Whoa.
哇哦。

09:33.608 --> 09:35.241
Oh!
哦！

09:36.474 --> 09:39.708
Have some slippery mustard,
slowpokes.
吃点滑溜溜的芥末，
慢吞吞的。

09:41.241 --> 09:45.241
- That was extra spicy
slippery mustard!
- 那太辣了
滑滑的芥末！

09:47.874 --> 09:50.174
- Oh, ratfish!
- 哦，鼠鱼！

09:50.241 --> 09:52.608
I've got one more trick
up me sleeve.
我还有一招
我的袖子。

09:54.874 --> 09:56.208
- This is the police.
- 这是警察。

09:56.274 --> 09:58.441
I'm pulling you over
for speeding!
我把你拉过来
因为超速！

09:58.508 --> 10:00.474
- No, this is the police.
- 不，这是警察。

10:00.608 --> 10:03.908
I'm pulling you over
for impersonating an officer.
我把你拉过来
冒充军官。

10:07.208 --> 10:09.474
- Here's your delivery, sir.
- 这是您的送货单，先生。

10:15.374 --> 10:16.841
I was hungry.
我很饿。

10:21.408 --> 10:23.274
- We win! We win!
- 我们赢了！我们赢了！

10:23.341 --> 10:26.341
- I--I had the best horsey!
I had the best horsey!
- 我--我有最好的马！
我有最好的马！

10:26.408 --> 10:29.108
- I don't want to be
a horse anymore.
- 我不想成为
一匹马了。

10:30.441 --> 10:32.341
Okay, buddy, but remember,
好吧，伙计，但是记住，

10:32.408 --> 10:34.808
you can still be anything.
你仍然可以成为任何人。

10:35.874 --> 10:37.608
- In that case,
- 在这种情况下，

10:37.608 --> 10:39.741
I think I'll be...
我想我会...

10:39.808 --> 10:40.941
a crab!
一只螃蟹！

10:41.008 --> 10:42.974
Ark, ark, ark, ark, ark, ark!
方舟，方舟，方舟，方舟，方舟，方舟！

10:44.208 --> 10:45.774
Oh, no, you don't!
哦，不，你不！

10:45.841 --> 10:47.908
Come back here with me claws!
带着我的爪子回到这里吧！

10:47.974 --> 10:50.341
How 'bout a ride back
搭车回来怎么样

10:50.408 --> 10:52.608
to the old Krusty Krab,
cowboy?
到老蟹堡，
牛仔？

11:05.941 --> 11:13.041
* *
**

**